  "version": "1.0.2",
  "description": [
    "A round gauge, like the health and mana globes of action RPGs: the liquid rises and falls with the value.",
    "",
    "When the value goes down, the previous level stays visible for a moment in a lighter liquid. The value can be shown as a number.",
    "It works like the resource bars: change its value with the \"Value\" action, and check it with the \"Is empty\" condition.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use orbs in many styles are in the asset store [resource orbs pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=resource-orbs-resource-orbs)."
